---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="San Francisco Motorcycle Accidents Attorney | The Sulfab Law Office"
  description="Injured in a motorcycle accident in San Francisco? Sulfab Law Office provides aggressive legal representation for riders. Call (415) 360-5266."
>
  <section class="relative bg-dark pt-28 pb-32 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <img src="/assets/images/hero-motorcycle.webp" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center" loading="eager" />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-dark/95 via-dark/80 to-slate-900/60"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-dark/20"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16 relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold rounded-full mb-8"></div>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Personal Injury</span>
        <h1 class="text-white text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight mb-6">San Francisco Motorcycle Accidents Lawyer</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-xl md:text-2xl max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-10">You are riding home when a car suddenly turns in front of you. In seconds, you are on the ground, dealing with pain, injuries, and confusion about what happens next.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 bg-gold text-white font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs hover:bg-amber-600 transition-all rounded-lg">Call (415) 360-5266</a>
          <a href="/#contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 border-2 border-white/25 text-white hover:border-gold hover:bg-white/5 transition-all rounded-lg">Free Case Review</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-slate-50/50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">You are riding home when a car suddenly turns in front of you. You hit the brakes, but there is not enough time to stop. In seconds, you are on the ground, dealing with pain, injuries, and confusion about what happens next.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">A motorcycle accident will leave you with medical bills, lost income, and many other things to worry about. If someone else was the cause of the collision, then you do not need to bear the legal process alone. A motorcycle accident lawyer in San Francisco could help you recover your losses.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed">The Sulfab Law Office assists injured motorcyclists in dealing with insurance companies and legal claims. We focus on the facts of your accident and work to protect your interests.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 border-t border-slate-100 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[5fr_7fr] gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Why It’s Different</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Why Motorcycle Accident Cases Are Different</h2>
          <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold rounded-full"></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">A motorcycle accident is a unique case and cannot be considered like an ordinary car crash because drivers do not always see a motorbike, particularly when switching lanes and turning left. An insurance company can also make accusations against a motorcyclist without considering the whole situation.</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">We study all the aspects of your case. We gather evidence, interview witnesses, analyze the police report, and cooperate with accident experts if necessary. This helps us build a strong claim based on the truth.</p>
          <div class="mt-8 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/50 border border-gold/20">
            <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium">Partnering with a motorcycle accident lawyer in San Francisco helps you have peace of mind since they know the legal and rider related challenges. We will handle the legal matters so you can concentrate on recovery.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50/50 border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">How We Help</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">How We Help Injured Riders</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto">The following are some ways we can assist you with a motorcycle accident:</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-50 text-gold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">✓</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Accident scene investigation</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-50 text-gold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">✓</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Gathering medical documentation, reports and evidence</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-50 text-gold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">✓</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Communicating with insurance companies</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-50 text-gold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">✓</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Estimating financial damages</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-50 text-gold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">✓</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Negotiating a favorable settlement</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-50 text-gold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">✓</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Taking your case to court if needed</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm text-center mt-6">We will try to get the maximum value of your claim, not just the initial offer from the insurance company.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50/50 border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Common Causes</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Common Causes of Motorcycle Accidents</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto">A lot of accidents happen when other drivers are negligent. Some of the common reasons include driving while being distracted, unsafe lane changes, speeding, driving under the influence of alcohol, tailgating, road debris, and bad road conditions. Finding the real cause is important because it helps prove who was responsible for your injuries.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Distracted driving</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Unsafe lane changes</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Speeding</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Driving under the influence</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Tailgating</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Road debris</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Bad road conditions</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Common Injuries</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Serious Injuries Riders May Suffer</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto">Riders can have injuries that will take time to heal. Some will require surgical treatment, physiotherapy, or other kinds of medical help.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Brain Injuries</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Head injuries are among the most serious risks for riders, even with a helmet, and may require long-term care.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Spinal Cord Damage</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Damage to the spinal cord can result in paralysis and require lifelong medical support.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Bone Fractures</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Fractures to arms, legs, and collarbones are common and often require surgery and months of rehabilitation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Road Rash</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Severe skin abrasions from sliding across pavement can cause deep tissue damage and require skin grafts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Internal Bleeding</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Blunt force trauma can damage internal organs and cause life-threatening complications.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Serious Soft Tissue Injuries</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">These injuries can affect your ability to work, care for your family, and enjoy everyday life.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50/50 border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Financial Recovery</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">What Compensation Can You Recover</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">If your accident was caused by someone else's negligence, you could potentially recover damages for your financial as well as personal losses. Every case is different, and thus the value of your claim depends on the extent of your injury and its impact on your life.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Medical Costs</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Cost of medical care and expected medical bills in the future related to your injuries.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Income Losses</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Compensation for income losses and diminished earning capacity.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Pain & Suffering</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Recovery for pain and suffering, emotional damage, rehab costs, and multi-vehicle claim complexities.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm text-center mt-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">In our law firm, we are aware that all victims of motorcycle accidents deserve respect and legal support. If your crash involved more than one vehicle, our motorcycle accident attorney in San Francisco has experience handling the added challenges that can come with multi-vehicle accident claims. We believe every client deserves clear communication, honest advice and dedicated legal support from start to finish.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">FAQ</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">What happens if the driver who was responsible for my accident had no insurance?</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">If you have been involved in an accident caused by an uninsured driver, there could be ways in which you can seek compensation. The insurance that you hold for your bike can cover you under uninsured or underinsured motorist coverage. It all depends on whether you have such coverage in your policy.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">What happens if the driver left the scene of the accident?</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">It is possible that you can pursue a claim for hit-and-run accidents. You need to report the accident to the police and receive necessary treatment. You will also need to gather evidence from the accident.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Can I obtain compensation for damage to my motorcycle?</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes. You can file a claim for your motorcycle and gear that were damaged by another party who was responsible for the accident.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Should I settle before finishing medical treatment?</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">This could be risky. You need to have full information regarding your condition and necessary treatments prior to reaching an agreement about compensation. After settlement, you will not be able to claim anything more.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-dark border-t border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4 italic font-serif">Contact us for a Consultation</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">You don't need to go through the legal process by yourself. If you are a victim of a motorcycle accident in San Francisco, contact The Sulfab Law Office right away.</p>
      <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 bg-gold text-white font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs hover:bg-amber-600 transition-all rounded-lg">Call (415) 360-5266 today</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
